  "ruleText": "Int 103.02 Communication with the Board. Persons wishing to make submissions to or requests of the board may communicate using the methods stated in Int 103.01.\n\nSource. #7851, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11",
